  "sourceTitle": "If open source can’t afford to train the frontier model, how can open source AI ever catch up?",
  "sourceBodyHash": "8909a2885e93f6b7e96158ed05924dcf90c73896a0cc6160f1773d0827a74289",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
