  "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free",
  "createdAt": "2026-09-25T20:45:35.888824Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-09-28T06:17:27.068010Z",
  "totalBlocks": 11,
  "translatedBlocks": 11,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "964fc2688d5d2f27",
      "translationZh": "Linux 是开源如何实现规模化扩展的一个有趣的例子。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "abfef0d9b108ad97",
      "translationZh": "一个规模不算大的核心可以变得极其庞大，因为成千上万的人可以在其基础上进行构建。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "599dde9704aefd8a",
      "translationZh": "但 AI 给人的感觉不同。最困难的部分——训练前沿模型——需要社区开发者通常不具备的海量算力和数据。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "608379d39ca36328",
      "translationZh": "因此我在想，开源 AI 是否需要一种不同的策略。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e92b6a24d4c8b208",
      "translationZh": "与其试图构建一个能与前沿模型相媲美的单一开源模型，我们是否可以构建一个由小型专家组成的团队？",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "946411c230d8ebc4",
      "translationZh": "编码 + 视觉 + 推理 + 搜索 + 工具",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3a1ee81d83ff706d",
      "translationZh": "甚至人类/专家反馈也可以成为该层级的一部分。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d0dc86cc55cb5244",
      "translationZh": "MoA 是这种思路的一种版本，但我考虑得更广泛：组合（composition）是否会成为开源 AI 实现规模化扩展的方式？",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "83dbc69abedad867",
      "translationZh": "这真的具有可行性吗？还是说单个大型前沿模型拥有无法通过组合来重现的能力？",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9f8537f48595d18d",
      "translationZh": "在这个世界里，相当于 Linux“内核”的东西会是什么？",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "52bcf1e239c69e90",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/WebAssemblyMan 提交",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    }
  ],
